        "page_content": "HUMAN: What's your return, cancellation and warranty policy?\nAI: Our return policy allows returns within 7 days of delivery for eligible items that are unused, in original packaging, and free from customer-caused damage. Please note that personal hygiene products, innerwear, perishable food, customized items, and gift cards are non-returnable. If a product arrives damaged, please report it within 48 hours. Regarding order cancellations and warranty coverage, the provided policy information does not contain details on these specific topics.\nHUMAN: tell me about cancellation policy\nAI: To cancel an order, you can do so before it has been shipped. If the order has already entered the shipping process, cancellation is not guaranteed. Once an item has shipped, it generally cannot be cancelled, though you may be able to refuse delivery or request a return upon receipt. To submit a request, please provide your Order ID, the specific item details, and the reason for cancellation. If you are cancelling individual items, you may do so as long as those specific items have not yet shipped.",
